{"title":"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_10\">Problem 10</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 10\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/a/7aa71782ef225695b800771069bfb06a49d8ebbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m,~n,~p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"63\" height=\"11\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are real numbers and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/3/5637a7011be7b5292024b98bba0772dcc846c3a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=mx+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"118\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/c/8ecbcd5ba7e8afde9d18621ba05cfce62ff65695.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)=px+q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"108\" height=\"18\" />, then the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/b/8cb76bfd66fcd6d6a65b98f4cdafbb09ab2458b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(g(x))=g(f(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"140\" height=\"18\" /> has a solution\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/9/f69a395394304ede6e78888da67fb2bea29f542f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\text{for all choices of }m,~n,~p, \\text{ and } q\\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{(B) }\\text{if and only if }m=p\\text{ and }n=q\\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{(C) }\\text{if and only if }mq-np=0\\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{(D) }\\text{if and only if }n(1-p)-q(1-m)=0\\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{(E) }\\text{if and only if }(1-n)(1-p)-(1-q)(1-m)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"414\" height=\"97\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/2/ac238cc7b5aa90d25f106f34a8ad60d6159bfdcd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(g(x) = g(f(x)) \\qquad \\implies \\qquad m(px + q) + n = p(mx + n) + q\\]\" width=\"502\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>This simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/6/616c87fad9500cf6f5d8929e0a0c0bdd1652145b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$mq + n = pn + q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"133\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/3/5b313d377b43dad83a91dc213e01b4b685902a4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n(1 - p) - q(1 - m) = 0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"194\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\nThe answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/a/3aaffab0f4c5610b12f5f960dbaabe4db56f9fe3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"44\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME\" title=\"1976 AHSME\">1976 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b